# 11_swamp_bloggtank_dark layer 2: the Power Bomb Guardian u05f8 fires its power bombs
# (CSporbPowerBomb): first at its picked floor targets (the timer scale is maxed on load), then,
# after SetToZero, at the player itself: impacts on the world and on the
# player, the blast's player and actor arms. Natural: run.sh tools/cov/specs/sporb_pbomb.py;
# the TestRayDamage-false arms: force.sh tools/cov/specs/sporb_pbomb_force.py (same driver).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/sporb_pbomb.py <out>
#   3dfd2249,11_swamp_bloggtank_dark --con tools/cov/specs/sporb_pbomb.con --fast --frames 2000
@f200 layer 2
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give powerBomb 5
@f305 tp -159 -106 -138
@f320 send u05f8 Activate; send u05f8 Alert; fsm u05f8 WakeUp
@f420 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f425 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f620 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f625 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f800 send u05f8 SetToZero
@f830 status
@f840 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f845 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f1040 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f1045 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f1240 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f1245 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f1440 tp -159 -112 -125
@f1450 fsm u05f8 Attack
@f1455 fsm u05f8 Fire
@f1700 status
